{"id":"dc642dd12c05d028","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-numbering.md","title":"标准程序编号与部分函数编号","display":"df-numbering — 标准程序编号与部分函数编号","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-numbering","aliases":["20-df-numbering"],"display":"df-numbering — 标准程序编号与部分函数编号","chapter":"1","section":"1.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 1.5.1","source_pdf_pages":[46],"source_printed_pages":[10],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-numbering — 标准程序编号与部分函数编号"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.5.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>46</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>10</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；固定本书的有限五元组程序编码和有效译码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\mapsto P_e\">\\(e\\mapsto P_e\\)</span>；无效代码译成恒发散程序。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<p>把原先固定的程序编号记为参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P:\\omega\\to\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathsf P:\\omega\\to\\mathcal M\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e=\\mathsf P(e)\">\\(P_e=\\mathsf P(e)\\)</span>；其有限状态及指令表的译码、有限程序的编码均是给定的有限算法。每个有限程序至少有一个代码，增加不可达状态的程序仍在该编号中。此处保留输入文本选定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P\">\\(\\mathsf P\\)</span>，不重新排列索引；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e(\\vec x)\">\\(P_e(\\vec x)\\)</span> 使用上游 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元输入配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\varphi_e^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\simeq P_e(\\vec x),\\qquad\n\\varphi_e:=\\varphi_e^{(1)},\\qquad\n\\{\\varphi_e^{(k)}:e\\in\\omega\\}=\\mathcal C_k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\varphi_e^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\simeq P_e(\\vec x),\\qquad\n\\varphi_e:=\\varphi_e^{(1)},\\qquad\n\\{\\varphi_e^{(k)}:e\\in\\omega\\}=\\mathcal C_k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>编码、译码只对有限对象进行有界运算，不使用停机判定。通过在程序末尾添加不可达状态，保留无限多个不同程序代码计算同一函数。此处固定的是有效程序编号；任何另选编号的适用条件另见 acceptable numbering。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.5.1；印刷页 10；PDF 第 46 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"e\\mapsto P_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf P:\\omega\\to\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"P_e=\\mathsf P(e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf P","display":false},{"tex":"P_e(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\varphi_e^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\simeq P_e(\\vec x),\\qquad\n\\varphi_e:=\\varphi_e^{(1)},\\qquad\n\\{\\varphi_e^{(k)}:e\\in\\omega\\}=\\mathcal C_k.","display":true}],"bytes":1701,"backlinks":[{"id":"c21e5e4663b12909","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]。"},{"id":"3850151d9f29cbf4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"1425fc4773bfa69c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"d92408f78f418e97","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"42a23ade1ce9e8e9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on",